# Keep binary files byte-exact on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout (where core.autocrlf defaults to true) is
# free to decide a file is text and rewrite its line endings. Git's guess is
# usually right, but "usually" is not a property you want for a 31 MB test
# fixture or a photomask.
*.mat  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.oas  binary
*.gds  binary
*.dll  binary
*.lib  binary
*.exe  binary
